# Allowlist for every build with this checkout as context (containers/onprem/platform.Dockerfile): code and the lock only.
# Root file on purpose: the legacy builder ignores <Dockerfile>.dockerignore, and .platform/ holds project capabilities and
# credentials. Keeps .platform/, runs/, outputs/, incoming/, web/, .venv/ and .env out of the build context.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!ehs_spatial/
!panoptes_worker/
!scripts/
!containers/onprem/serve_publications.py
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
